iterations.reply:
I've left out both operations requests. The node's declared capabilities are only `LLMClient<inference>`, and the two requests would add authority the graph doesn't grant. A log write needs a filesystem import the node doesn't have. The metadata fetch needs `http-client` with an allowlist that includes `metadata.internal.example`, and it would send untrusted feed text to an external host. The URL also embeds that text unencoded. If ops wants these, they should go in a separate node or the host's observability layer, with the capability declared in the graph.

